// A fresh public constant that only a rule's `_restrict` formula mentions.
//
// `freshNamesReport'` (Theory/Tools/Wellformedness.hs) collects the
// names of a rule with `universeBi`, which reaches the `_preRestriction`
// formula (Theory/Model/Rule.hs) the `_restrict` construct leaves there
// (Theory/Text/Parser.hs).  `~'foo'` is a literal, not a free
// variable, so `rewrite` returns it unchanged
// (Theory/Model/Restriction.hs) and the action fact
// `fromRuleRestriction` adds to the rule (Theory/Model/Restriction.hs)
// carries nothing, so the name is reachable only through the rule info.
//
// Both engines also reach `~'foo'` through the generated `Restr_R_1`
// restriction and report it under `Formula terms`, so the block carries two
// topics.
//
// Mode `match`: the two engines agree on this shape.
//
// Compared slice: the wf report block.


theory S8RestrictFreshName
begin

rule R:
  [ Fr(~x) ]
  --[ _restrict( not( ~'foo' = 'a' ) ) ]->
  [ Out(~x) ]

end
